{#
Wrapper around the MOJ Multi File Upload component. Renders a file upload area with a list of
previously uploaded files, each with a delete button.

Parameters (all within the main input params object):
@param classes:        optional string (additional CSS classes for the container element)
@param attributes:     optional object (key-value pairs of HTML attributes for the container element)
@param uploadHtml:     string (raw HTML for the upload input area, rendered inside .moj-multi-file-upload__upload)
@param uploadedFiles:  object describing the uploaded files section:
    {
        heading: {
            text: string (plain text heading), OR
            html: string (HTML heading, takes precedence over text)
        },
        hint: optional string (HTML hint text shown below the heading),
        items: array of uploaded file objects, each with:
            {
                id:       string (the file ID, used as the value of the delete button),
                filename: string (the display name of the file)
            }
    }
#}
{% macro carMultiFileUpload(params) %}
  {%- include "./template.njk" -%}
{% endmacro %}
